OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1789943292
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 5 Oct to Mon 19 Oct
OL,6,FThrough October, changeable and
OL,7,Foccasionally unsettled weather is
OL,8,Flikely to become more frequent, with
OL,9,Fspells of rain moving in from the
OL,10,FAtlantic. Between these periods, drier
OL,11,Fand brighter interludes are expected.
OL,12,FAs is often the case for October,
OL,13,Fdeeper areas of low pressure may also
OL,14,Fbring periods of very strong winds,
OL,15,Fespecially across the north and west.
OL,16,FTemperatures are expected to remain
OL,17,Fslightly above average overall,
OL,18,Falthough brief cooler interludes are
OL,19,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
